OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying mostly dry, with spells
OL,6,Fof warm sunshine. Sunshine turning
OL,7,Fhazy in the west through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Light easterly winds but
OL,9,Ffeeling slightly warmer than on Monday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,12,Fbut cloud will start to thick across
OL,13,Fhigher ground to the north overnight.
OL,14,FThundery showers moving in from the
OL,15,Fsouth towards dawn. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
